## Summary
Far-right Israeli MP Zvi Sukkot destroyed a Palestinian memorial in the West Bank while under IDF escort. The incident was captured on video and has drawn condemnation.

## Key Points
- Far-right Israeli MP Zvi Sukkot smashed a Palestinian memorial using what appears to be a sledgehammer
- The destruction took place in the West Bank
- The incident occurred under Israeli Defense Forces (IDF) escort
- The act has drawn public condemnation


